FamilyTree.person({"id":"hendrik_vdb","name":"Henricus Augustinus Vandenbemden","dates":"19 Aug 1849 Everberg – 12 Aug 1889 Kraainem","confidence":"doc","surname":"Vandenbemden","family":"vandenbemden","born":"19 Aug 1849 Everberg","order":"1849-08-19","died":"12 Aug 1889 Kraainem","branch":"Thumas","line":"thumas","spouses":[{"id":"coekelberghs","name":"Maria Theresia Coekelberghs","detail":"24 Apr 1873"}],"source":"Kraainem marriage act nr. 2, 3 February 1902 — Thumas × Vandenbemden; Geneanet","note":"Source detail: Geneanet; daughter Joanna's 1902 Kraainem marriage act\n\nBorn in Everberg; married Maria Theresia Coekelberghs in 1873; died young (1889) at Sint-Stevens-Woluwe. Named in daughter Joanna's 1902 marriage act. FRONTIER (to verify): his parents per Geneanet were Joannes Baptista Vandenbemden × Agatha Langa.\n\nCORRECTED (July 2026). This record gave his death place as Sint-Stevens-Woluwe.\nthe Kraainem marriage act of 3 February 1902 (akte nr. 2, [[S5]]), which names him as the bride's late father, states **Kraainem** — with the death\ndate, 12 August 1889, agreeing exactly. The same man, the wrong commune; the place is now\nas the act has it. He had died thirteen years before his daughter married."});
