FamilyTree.person({"id":"henricus_e_v","name":"Henricus Emilius Vanstechelman","dates":"1877 – 17 Jan 1941 Oostende","confidence":"sup","surname":"Vanstechelman","family":"vanstechelman","sex":"m","born":"1877","order":"1877","died":"17 Jan 1941 Oostende","branch":"Vanstechelman","line":"vanstechelman","father":"petrusjacobus_v","mother":"clementia_w","spouses":[{"name":"Alicia Mathildis St Martin"}],"source":"België, West-Vlaanderen, burgerlijke stand, 1582-1950","note":"Elder brother of [[augusta]], and so a brother-in-law of Petrus Franciscus Bundervoet.\n\nFrom his own Oostende death registration of 17 January 1941, which names his parents as\nPetrus Jacobus and Clemencia Sophia Wagebaert and his wife as Alicia Mathildis St Martin.\nThe birth year of 1877 is the one the death act implies rather than a stated date, so it is\nrecorded as a bare year.\n\nThe act is an index entry and has not been read as an image, which is why this stays `sup`.\nHis wife has no record of her own yet."});
