FamilyTree.person({"id":"magdalena_vb","name":"Maria Magdalena Van Bogaert","dates":"25 Jul 1861 Nieuwkerken-Waas – 31 Dec 1928 Sint-Niklaas","confidence":"doc","surname":"Van Bogaert","family":"vanbogaert","born":"25 Jul 1861 Nieuwkerken-Waas","order":"1861-07-25","died":"31 Dec 1928 Sint-Niklaas","occupation":"huishoudster (housekeeper)","branch":"Paelinck","line":"paelinck","father":"carolus_vb","mother":"martinet","spouses":[{"id":"eduardus_p","name":"Eduardus Paelinck","detail":"Sint-Niklaas, 17 Nov 1888 — her 2nd marriage"}],"source":"Birth registration nr. 997 — Philomena Leonia Paelinck, Sint-Niklaas, 31 October 1901; Birth act of Philomena Leonia Paelinck, Sint-Niklaas, 31 October 1901; stefpaelinck (Stef Paelinck)","note":"Widowed young — her first husband Ludovicus Brion died in 1887 — then remarried Eduardus Paelinck in 1888. Buried at Begraafplaats Tereken, Sint-Niklaas. Daughter of Carolus Van Bogaert & Maria Martinet.\n\nCORROBORATED (July 2026) as a mother: named in her daughter Léonie's Sint-Niklaas birth\nact of 31 October 1901, alongside [[eduardus_p]].\n\nCONFIRMED BY A CIVIL RECORD (July 2026): named as the mother on her daughter's Sint-Niklaas\nbirth registration of 31 October 1901 ([[S16]]), alongside [[eduardus_p]].\n\nREGISTER PAGE READ (July 2026): named in her daughter's 1901 Sint-Niklaas birth act as\n*Maria Magdalena Van Bogaert*, **huishoudster** — an occupation this record did not carry."});
