FamilyTree.person({"id":"nicolas_verbrugghe","name":"Nicolas Verbrugghe","dates":"","confidence":"sup","surname":"Verbrugghe","family":"verbrugghe","branch":"Bundervoet","line":"bundervoet","spouses":[{"name":"(wife unrecorded)"}],"source":"paulderidder","note":"Father of Joanna (Janneken) Verbrugghe (~1655–1704), and so a direct ancestor through\nher son Joannes Bundervoet (~1682).\n\nNamed as her father in the paulderidder tree's ancestry chart; the tree gives him no\ndates at all and no wife, which is why this record carries none either. Joanna's\nrecord previously said her parents were \"not recorded here\" — they were, and this\ncorrects that.\n\nFRONTIER: everything about him. Evergem parish registers for a Verbrugghe–? marriage\nin the 1640s–50s would be the first place to look, since a daughter born ~1655 puts\nthe marriage a little before it."});
