FamilyTree.person({"id":"peremans","name":"Joanna Catharina Jacoba Peremans","dates":"1824 – 1907","confidence":"doc","surname":"Peremans","family":"peremans","born":"1824","order":"1824","died":"1907","occupation":"huishoudster (housekeeper)","branch":"Thumas","line":"thumas","spouses":[{"id":"guilielmus_bossin","name":"Guilielmus Bossin"}],"source":"Kraainem marriage act nr. 2, 20 June 1872 — Thumas × Bossin (read on AGATHA); Marriage act — Georges Carolus Josephus Thumas × Antonia Bossin, Kraainem, 20 June 1872","note":"CORROBORATED (July 2026) as a mother, by her daughter's Kraainem marriage act of\n20 June 1872, which names the bride's parents as Guilielmus Bossin and *Anna* Catharina\nPeremans. The act's forenames are shorter than the ones this record carries — Anna\nCatharina against Joanna Catharina Jacoba — which is ordinary for a civil act quoting a\nparent, but it is a difference, and it is recorded rather than smoothed over.\n\nACT READ (July 2026): named in her daughter's 1872 marriage act as *huishoudster*, living\nat Kraainem. The act calls her Anna Catharina; this record calls her Joanna Catharina\nJacoba. Both stand."});
